// Template of Secrets.mc, the file that holds the Gemini API key. Secrets.mc is ignored by git
// (see the root .gitignore), so the real key never reaches the repository.
//
// To build the app: copy this file to Secrets.mc in this same folder and replace the value with a
// key from Google AI Studio (https://aistudio.google.com/apikey). The compiler only reads .mc
// files, so this template is never compiled.
//
// The key ends up inside the compiled .prg, where anyone holding the file could read it. Use a
// key restricted to the Generative Language API, for the demo only.
const GEMINI_API_KEY = "TU_API_KEY_AQUI";
